---
import Page from '../components/Page.astro'
---
<Page currentPath="/privacy" title="Privacy Policy — Jhelum Labs" description="Jhelum Labs Privacy Policy for research publications and model weights.">
  <div class="shell prose-page">
    <header class="prose-header">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">Legal & Compliance</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-abstract">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-content">
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        Jhelum Labs ("we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy. This research portal provides static technical documentation, papers, and open-weights download links for the W-1.1 model program.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not require user registration or account creation. We do not use third-party tracking pixels, advertising trackers, or personal profile tracking.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Technical Documentation & Code Access</h2>
      <p>
        The research portal provides open documentation and links to verify model checkpoints. We do not track personal identifying data or user search queries.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Model Weights Downloads</h2>
      <p>
        When you download weights or code from external repositories (such as GitHub or HuggingFace), standard server logs of the hosting provider may apply.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, please contact <a href="mailto:privacy@jhelumlabs.in" style="color: var(--brand);">privacy@jhelumlabs.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Page>
